---
import { render } from 'astro:content';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { catalog, tags, href, tagLabel } from '../lib/catalog';
const { active, demo } = await catalog();
const cards = await Promise.all(active.map(async post => ({ post, Content: (await render(post)).Content })));
---
<Layout title="今日回忆" active="review"><div class="review-heading"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">LESS READING. MORE RECALLING.</p><h1>先试着想，<br />再看看答案。</h1><p>不必一次记住所有。每一次主动回忆，都会让下一次更容易。</p>{demo && <span class="demo-label">示例复习 · 不计入真实记录</span>}</header><div class="review-tools"><label class="sr-only" for="review-tag">按标签复习</label><select id="review-tag"><option value="">所有主题</option>{tags.map(tag => <option value={tag.id}>{tag.label}</option>)}</select><label class="muted"><input id="review-all" type="checkbox" /> 包含未到期题目</label></div></div><section class="review-shell" data-pagefind-ignore><div class="review-stats"><div><strong id="review-pending">0</strong><span>今日待回忆</span></div><div><strong id="review-done">0</strong><span>今天已回忆</span></div><div><strong>{active.length}</strong><span>{demo ? '道示例题' : '道提问'}</span></div></div><p id="review-warning" class="review-warning" role="alert" hidden></p><div id="review-empty" class="empty-state" hidden><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE EVERY DAY</p><h2>今天的回忆，完成了。</h2><p>下次到期时，问题会重新出现在这里。也可以勾选“包含未到期题目”继续练习。</p><a class="button" href={href()}>回到时间线 →</a></div><div id="review-cards">{cards.map(({ post, Content }) => <article class="review-card" data-card-id={post.data.id} data-card-tags={post.data.tags.join(',')} hidden><div class="review-card-top"><span>THE QUESTION</span><span data-card-position></span></div><h2>{post.data.title}</h2><p class="review-original">{post.data.question}</p><div class="tag-list" style="margin-top:15px">{post.data.tags.map((tag: string) => <span class="tag">{tagLabel(tag)}</span>)}</div><p class="recall-prompt">给自己一点时间：如果面试官坐在对面，你会怎么解释？</p><details><summary><Icon name="book" size={17} />展开答案，检查我的回忆 <span>↓</span></summary><div class="prose"><Content /></div><a class="text-link small" href={href(`questions/${post.data.id}/`)}>查看完整记录 ↗</a></details></article>)}</div><div class="review-ratings" id="review-ratings" hidden><button type="button" data-rating="forgot" disabled>忘记了<small>明天再来一次</small></button><button type="button" data-rating="fuzzy" disabled>有些模糊<small>保持当前间隔</small></button><button type="button" data-rating="remembered" disabled>记住了<small>延长复习间隔</small></button></div><p id="review-feedback" class="review-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="review-bottom"><p class="review-notice">进度仅保存在当前浏览器。更换设备前，请导出备份。<br />复习间隔：1 → 3 → 7 → 14 → 30 天。</p><div class="backup-actions"><button id="export-progress" type="button"><Icon name="download" size={15} />导出进度</button><label for="import-progress"><Icon name="upload" size={15} />导入备份</label><input class="sr-only" type="file" id="import-progress" accept="application/json,.json" /></div></div><noscript><p class="review-warning">复习卡片需要 JavaScript。你仍可以打开题目详情阅读完整问答。</p></noscript></section><script src="../scripts/review.ts"></script></Layout>
